  "definition": "Pharmacy Lock-In Program",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-05-22",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #5742, eff 12-1-93, EXPIRED: 12-1-99 New. #7392, eff 10-28-00; ss by #7680, eff 4-20-02; ss by #7712, INTERIM, eff 6-22-02, EXPIRED: 12-19-02 New. #7805, eff 12-21-02; ss by #8636, eff 5-26-06; ss by #9586, eff 11-4-09, EXPIRED: 11-4-09 New. #12421, INTERIM, eff 11-21-17, EXPIRED: 5-20-18 New. #12529, eff 5-22-18",
